<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#hasRecordedInputFlowForLot> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#hasRecordedInputFlowForLot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "R03 associates recorded purchased input flow with the lot through the manufacturing execution and its separately identified LCI representation; no emissions are asserted." .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#hasRecordedInputFlowForLot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#Lot> .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#hasRecordedInputFlowForLot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ProductFlow> .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#impactThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#impactThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parámetro histórico genérico conservado por compatibilidad; R04 del catálogo canónico utiliza research:ThresholdRecord con valor, unidad y categoría acoplados en el mismo registro. No se usa GlobalConfig para combinar umbrales de distintas magnitudes."@es .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#impactThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "impactThreshold" .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#impactThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
