<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#indicatorForLot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Environmental indicator and quality record independently refer to the same lot via indicatorForLot and qualityForLot. Their values and types remain distinct." .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#indicatorForLot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ImpactIndicator> .
