<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#inputFlowForResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Purchased inputs are technosphere ProductFlow records linked to consumed material resources; consumption never implies an elementary nature exchange." .
<http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#inputFlowForResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#ProductFlow> .
